# Consolidated CSVs are rebuilt from data/history by
# scripts/openrouter_consolidate.py. Committing them would add a fresh
# compressed copy of every changed table to git history on every daily run
# (~16MB/commit, ~6GB/year); the partitions cost under 1MB/day.
data/openrouter/*.csv
